# Line endings are LF everywhere, matching Backend/.editorconfig (end_of_line = lf).
# Git normalizes text files to LF on commit and checks them out as LF whatever core.autocrlf says,
# so Windows, CI, and tooling that generates CRLF (dotnet ef migrations, Visual Studio) all agree
# and a stray line-ending difference can never show up as a modified file again.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: no text conversion, no textual diffs.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.eot binary
*.pdf binary
*.docx binary
*.xlsx binary
*.zip binary
*.bak binary
